{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 22, "ref": "judges 21:22", "book": "judges", "lang": "sv", "chapter": 21, "translation": "Och det skall ske, när deras fäder eller deras bröder komma till oss för att träta, skola vi säga till dem: Var oss nådiga ⟨angående⟩ dem, ⟨את⟩ ty vi hava icke tagit var och en sin hustru i kriget, och I haven icke givit dem ⟨döttrarna⟩; skullen I nu bliva skyldiga.", "tokens": [{"surface": "והיה", "gloss": "och det skall ske"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "när"}, {"surface": "יבאו", "gloss": "komma"}, {"surface": "אבותם", "gloss": "deras fäder"}, {"surface": "או", "gloss": "eller"}, {"surface": "אחיהם", "gloss": "deras bröder"}, {"surface": "לרוב", "gloss": "för att träta"}, {"surface": "אלינו", "gloss": "till oss"}, {"surface": "ואמרנו", "gloss": "skola vi säga"}, {"surface": "אליהם", "gloss": "till dem"}, {"surface": "חנונו", "gloss": "var oss nådiga"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "dem (döttrarna)"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "ty"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "icke"}, {"surface": "לקחנו", "gloss": "hava vi tagit"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "var och en"}, {"surface": "אשתו", "gloss": "sin hustru"}, {"surface": "במלחמה", "gloss": "i kriget"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "och"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "icke"}, {"surface": "אתם", "gloss": "I"}, {"surface": "נתתם", "gloss": "haven givit"}, {"surface": "להם", "gloss": "dem"}, {"surface": "כעת", "gloss": "nu"}, {"surface": "תאשמו", "gloss": "skullen I bliva skyldiga"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:06:38.400754809Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}